    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jaliida Yeremiya sea ashoohoocheanda siguura Bashuri",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ashoohoocheanda siguura Bashuri, was orjeeda Imeri, nea niny abeeda ea siida haw miineadaysa gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA, hean ghwayiiy ng'asheega ramooran Yeremiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghabwar Bashuri Yeremiyaheeda was sibaneeda, ak gwajaksa ghealooniga mida gidaghuuta duukusa heetiyeada bea Benjamini aba jeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu sakteayda gootin aba ghealooniga Bashuri sibaneeda was Yeremiya, hean gwayeesha Yeremiya niny, “NG'UTAMIIDA maygudu gaguureeweeyi Bashuri, hean geeguureeweeyi Haloota gwanda meadajeega sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA: Ng'ula, gaydanung' huwa haloota aba badaydaang'u ea heeda fuga irooroocheewi. Hean gaygahuuyda ng'ula weajoodiga nyaawa nea ang'iing'i ging'ulu. Ak gaydaahaak fuga Yuda heeda geatinga sugoocheanda Babeli; ak gayghwaat saawa ghoah soomjooga aba Babeli, aba ng'ata gaygahuuyda saawa aba ng'uta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba ng'ata gaydaadaw saawa meanang'oocheanduumeeda mida jeeda mujiini, ea haleanjeeda mida jeeda, ea gea haw sheayeat, ea gheaseeda sugoodiga Yuda heeda weajoodiga nyaawa, ak gayghaghas aba uurda, ak ghwaat Babeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ang'iing'i, Ea Bashuri, ea fuga sean abiita gheang'u, gajeayaadeagwa ahuwa giing'oonyanga, gajeayadeagwa Babeli, ak gajameewiisiina hoowa, ak geebung'seegwa hoowa, agooga sea fuga oorooroocheewi, gea ghayi iramooriisi ng'uyeega.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yeremiya gooniiksa NG'UTAMIIDA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ea NG'UTAMIIDA, ang'iing'i nireenganean,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
